  "body": "*\tPrime Orewa Location: Sought-after coastal living\r\n*\t521 sqm Land Area: Generous and manageable section\r\n*\t310 sqm Floor Area: Expansive double-level family space\r\n*\tSpacious 6 Bedrooms: Exceptional family flexibility\r\n*\tGranny Flat Potential: Ground floor suite with sitting area \r\n*\tUpstairs Living Hub: Open-plan kitchen and dining \r\n*\tMassive Outdoor Deck: Perfect for summer BBQs \r\n*\tDual Family Lounges: Separate spaces to unwind \r\n*\tPrivate Master Suite: Features walk-in robe and study \r\n*\tAmple Parking Space: Double garage plus large front area \r\n\r\nIf space is what you've been searching for, then 19 Tawa Place deserves to be at the top of your list! Offering an impressive 310sqm (approx.) of floor area, this substantial 6 beds home delivers room for the whole family, multiple living options.\r\n\r\nUpon entering the home, you are welcomed by a spacious lounge, providing a comfortable setting for family entertainment or simply relaxing. Further through the ground floor, you will find two bedrooms serviced by a family bathroom, offering practical accommodation for family members or guests. In addition, another two bedrooms are complemented by their own sitting area, providing extra flexibility for extended family, teenagers or those seeking additional private space, with granny potential.\r\n\r\nMoving upstairs, at its heart of the home is the kitchen and dining area create a welcoming space for everyday family life. The dining area opens onto a huge outdoor deck, providing the perfect setting for summer BBQs, family gatherings and entertaining friends while enjoying the relaxed coastal lifestyle Orewa is known for. A second lounge upstairs offers additional living space for the whole family to spread out and unwind.\r\n\r\nThe upper level also features another generous bedroom serviced by a family bathroom, while the master bedroom provides a private sanctuary complete with a walk-in wardrobe and a dedicated study room, ideal for working from home or enjoying a quiet space of your own.\r\n\r\nWith a generous double garage and a huge parking area at the front of the property, there is plenty of room for multiple cars, a boat or motorhome, making parking easy and convenient for the whole family.\r\nLocated within easy reach of Orewa Beach, local schools, shops, cafés and motorway access, this home offers the perfect balance of space, convenience and coastal living.\r\n\r\nWhether you are looking for a spacious family home or a flexible multi-generational living solution, this is an opportunity you won't want to miss. Vendors are downsizing and have made their instructions clear - this home will be SOLD.\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this don't come around often. Act fast, attend one of our open homes or contact us today to arrange your private viewing.",
